---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
import { href } from '../lib/url';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your data (short version: we collect almost none).`} updated="2026-11-04">
  <p>This policy explains what happens to your data when you visit {SITE.name}. The short version: we don't run accounts, newsletters, comments or analytics on this site, and we don't set cookies ourselves.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We don't ask for or store personal information. There are no sign-ups or forms on this site.</p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is a set of static pages served by our hosting provider (currently GitHub Pages). Like any web server, the host may log technical data such as your IP address, browser type and the pages requested, to keep the service secure and running. That processing is governed by the host's own privacy policy, for example the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener">GitHub General Privacy Statement</a>.</p>

  <h2>YouTube videos</h2>
  <p>Posts include a preview image of the related YouTube video. The preview image is loaded from YouTube's image servers (i.ytimg.com), which can see your IP address, as with any web request. The actual video player is <strong>not</strong> loaded until you click play. When you do, the player loads from YouTube's privacy-enhanced domain (youtube-nocookie.com), and YouTube may then collect data under the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>Your settings</h2>
  <p>If you use the light/dark switch, your choice is saved in your own browser's local storage so the site remembers it. It never leaves your device, and you can clear it at any time by clearing your browser's site data.</p>

  <h2>Future changes</h2>
  <p>If we ever add analytics, advertising or affiliate links, some of those services may use cookies or similar technology. We'll update this page before that happens and change the date above. Affiliate links will always be disclosed; see our <a href={href('affiliate-disclosure/')}>affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is a general-audience site and isn't directed at children under 13. We don't knowingly collect data from anyone.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy? See our <a href={href('contact/')}>contact page</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
